E90F: CD C2 E5            942 | DIR9:   CALL    KSTAT   ;CHECK KEY BOARD, ANY KEY BREAKS
E912: C2 1B E9            943 |     JNZ DIR10   ;Exit on break
E915: CD E4 E4            944 |     CALL    SRCHNX  ;Look for another directory item
